WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 1. Expand Discovery and choose End Point Explorer.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 1. Choose Select managed networks to open the selection control.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Step 2. Search by name or ID, then tick the networks you need.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 2. Choose Update. An ICT system selection would replace these networks.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Step 3. Open Security Domain. Keep PROTECTED; untick SECRET and UNKNOWN.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.000
Step 3. Choose Update. Keep at least one domain and a network or ICT system.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Step 4. Set Date to 4 November 2026, then check Snapshot on the page.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:52.000
Step 4. Snapshot is 31 October: the most recent saved data on or before the chosen date.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.500
Step 5. Open Installed Software Explorer. Your selections carry across.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:05.000
Step 5. Before sharing a result, check networks or systems, domains and the loaded snapshot.
